  <text x="48" y="148" font-family="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif" font-size="38" font-weight="600" fill="#1A1A1A" style="fill:rgb(26, 26, 26);stroke:none;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:-apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:38px;font-weight:600;text-anchor:start;dominant-baseline:auto">여행 환율</text>
